Z||000000||TRiAD||07-26-2001||09:56 AM||||OK guys, forget your Mercedes, Porsche, Lamborghini, Ferrari, etc...I'm looking for REAL <I><B>exclusivity</B></I>. <BR>Cars with no more than 5 copies ever built. The fewer the better, and the faster the better!<P>Here's my first submission (oh, and PLEASE include pics...it's a big Web, go find it...)<P><B>1991 Lotec/Mercedes C1000</B><P> <IMG SRC="http://members.tripod.com/auto-tuning/images/celemai/lotec1.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://members.tripod.com/auto-tuning/images/celemai/lotec3.gif"> <P>Only two ever made. The Mercedes turbocharged engine puts out an amazing 850 horsepower and 730 lb-ft of torque. 0-60mph in 3.2 sec., top speed 234mph. Original sticker $1.8M! This makes the it one of the most powerful and most expensive cars of all time. <P><I>TRiAD Motorsports has one of these 2 cars available for purchase...If you know anyone with about $1M loose change, have them give me a shout.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></I><P>So, let's see your submissions for the most exclusive cars! <P>||||reg||6
